Thought:[32;1m[1;3mFinal Answer:

#### Sets and Indices

- Let $I$ be the set of shelves, indexed by $i$ (from the resource_id column in capacity.csv).
- Let $J$ be the set of products, indexed by $j$ (from the item_name column in products.csv).

#### Parameters

From capacity.csv (in source order):

